        {
          "text": "Hakaba hariho omushaija wa Zoora, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani, orikwetwa Manoa; omukazi we akaba ari engumba, ataine mwana weena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
