                  "text": "1 Bus 21:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Endimi z'omuriro ku zaimukire ahaiguru niziruga aha itambiro, maraika wa MUKAMA yaatembera omuri ezo ndimi ezaaruga aha itambiro, Manoa n'omukazi we nibabireeba; ku baabireebire, baagwa ahansi bajuumaire.",
          "type": "text",
