              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka omukazi we yaagira ati: Kuri noogira ngu MUKAMA abaire naayenda kutwita, takwakiire kitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano y'esaano ebi twamuhongyera, kandi takutworekire ebyo byona, n'obu kwakuba okutugambira ebigambo ebyo byona omu bunaku obu.",
          "type": "text",
